Spec: Project/Dependencies

Purpose:
  Describes the relationships between project components â€” schema/glossary
   only. Concrete dependency graphs (which module depends on which) will
   live inside each domain's own model, when domains are rebuilt.

RelationTypes:
  depends_on
  produces
  consumes
  calls
  owns
  tested_by
  deployed_by

Rules:
  Dependencies MUST have an explicit owner.
  Circular dependencies MUST be detectable.
  New dependencies MUST be evaluated against architecture.sdd.

